        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur GEOGVC, Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe fancy styling of the Ornate Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose makes it both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. The Grande Victorian Knobset is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The Georgetown's Rosette design combined with the ornate egg shaped Grande Victorian Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-georgetown-series\"><b>Georgetown Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur GEOGVC Ornate Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Georgetown Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Grande Victorian Knob Projection: 2.32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-GEOGVC-Specification.pdf?v=1704262181\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur GEOGVC Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose",
                "description": "Grandeur GEOGVC, Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose - The fancy styling of the Ornate Grande Victorian Knob With Georgetown Rose makes it both a standout and a standard in decorative door hardware. The Grande Victorian Knobset is a prime example of tasteful elegance. It has a stately look without being gaudy. The Georgetown's Rosette design combined with the ornate egg shaped Grande Victorian Knob will enhance the elegance of your home in any of the beautiful finish choices. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
